    "revision": 1,
    "verified_on": "2026-11-15",
    "evidence": "Verified on real sheets 2026-11-15: HP Color LaserJet, tray 1, check print within +0.3 / ±0.2 mm. 5 columns of 38.1 mm with no horizontal gap (190.5 mm), rows 21.18 mm (275.34 mm); left edge 9.9 mm from the template, top 10.8 mm confirmed by the calibration print. Corner radius unknown. 65 labels per sheet; `-65` is the pack of 65 sheets.",
